        "checksum": "19a2376b6219da294fef0319d3d4b6934ed7711dc65b6ab126336b1fcf463700_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg-Zky-YmOX_text": "<p>The first creatine gummy in individual serving pouches. Toss in your gym bag. No jars. No mess. No sticky clumps.</p>",
