        "ggA0QLTPCKQ_text": "<span style=\"color:rgb(58,90,64);\"><strong>67% of Creatine Gummies Contain Virtually No Creatine. </strong></span><span style=\"background-color:rgba(189,229,34,0.77);color:rgb(58,90,64);\"><i><strong>Here’s How We Proved FusiForce Is Different</strong></i></span>",
        "ggHJ7LFm4lL_text": "<p><strong>Other founders got caught selling creatine-free gummies and blamed suppliers. We built a brand that never needs excuses.</strong></p><p><br>It took 10 months to perfect highest-purity creatine monohydrate plus Panax Ginseng (10% ginsenosides). Creatine breaks down in heat into useless creatinine — most brands fail lab tests. We solved it.</p><p><br>We vetted 50+ manufacturers, chose the most rigorous, and now audit every batch post-cook via ISO 17025 labs.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"#g3wTy8wfqJ\"><strong><u>Result: 99% purity. Full 5,000mg in just 3 gummies. Every report published.</u></strong></a></p>",
        "ggSNBDKHLrM_childItem_0": "<p>FREE Shipping For Orders Above $70</p>",
        "ggTMEn_vDHT_text": "<p>Tested after cooking, not before. Mutual audits with our manufacturer. Full 5g clinical dose + standardized Panax Ginseng.</p>",
        "ggVtdbmYxsK_text": "Our Innovation",
        "ggXlbhOQz8n_label": "<p>TRY FUSIFORCE TODAY!</p>",
        "ggb9UVdlMg9_text": "We're No. 1 On Transparent Creatine Gummies Brand In USA",
