        "ggo_DvKcLxs_text": "<p>8 of 10 top brands on Amazon failed. 3 had zero creatine. One delivered just 0.5% of its label claim.</p>",
        "ggxkV_cka-Q_childItem_0": "<p>24/7 Customer Service</p>"
      },
